以朓或覽混同。","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"external_reference_readings":[{"raw_path":"source-evidence/nanqi043-xieyue-reading/external/liang015-fixed.wikitext","metadata_path":"source-evidence/nanqi043-xieyue-reading/external/liang015-metadata.json","revision_id":1506954,"raw_sha256":"0ae55481ce12880db956ce367fee817fd1cd64f07685408996c5f31f080ffff6","read_segments":[{"first_line":11,"last_line":11,"raw_start":166,"raw_end":327,"raw_quote":"　　謝朏字敬沖，陳郡陽夏人也。祖弘微，宋太常卿，父莊，右光祿大夫，並有名前代。朏幼聰慧，莊器之，常置左右。年十歲，能屬文。莊游土山賦詩，使朏命篇，朏攬筆便就。琅邪王景文謂莊曰：「賢子足稱神童，復爲後來特達。」莊笑，因撫朏背曰：「真吾家千金。」孝武帝游姑孰，勑莊攜朏從駕，詔使爲《洞井贊》，於坐奏之。帝曰：「雖小，奇童也。」"}],"scope":"本傳邊界及謝朏首段、弟子覽傳首；未匯入梁015，非謝𤅢梁本傳。"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p001","unit_id":"xieyue-complete","text":"謝𤅢字義潔，陳郡陽夏人也。祖弘微，宋太常。父莊，金紫光祿大夫。𤅢四兄颺、朏、顥、嵷，世謂謝莊名兒爲風、月、景、山、水。顥字仁悠，少簡靜。解褐祕書郎，累至太祖驃騎從事中郎。建元初，爲吏部郎，至太尉從事中郎。永明初，高選友、學，以顥爲竟陵王友。至北中郎長史。卒。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","source_position":{"first_line":53,"last_line":53,"revision_id":2400356,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"謝𤅢","kind":"person","person_id":"dw5_ots_441","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"原文具名或局部代稱；身份依全傳及具體來源橋接，不按同字跨世代配人。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-yue"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p001:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"義潔","kind":"person","person_id":"dw5_ots_441","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"原文具名或局部代稱；身份依全傳及具體來源橋接，不按同字跨世代配人。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-yue"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p001:m0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"弘微","kind":"person","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_DBAB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"原文具名或局部代稱；身份依全傳及具體來源橋接，不按同字跨世代配人。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-hongwei"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p001:m0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"莊","kind":"person","person